#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3136
msgid "<parameter>z</parameter>-Test: Two Samples for Means Tool"
msgstr "<parameter>z</parameter>-test: verktyg för medelvärden i två urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3138
msgid "<parameter>z</parameter>-Test Tool Dialog Options"
msgstr "<parameter>z</parameter>-test: dialogrutealternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3140
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ztest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the options"
" in a z-test of two samples.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ztest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av alternativen"
" för ett z-test av två urval.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3152
msgid ""
"For unpaired variables with known population variances, enter those "
"variances in the <quote><guilabel>Variable 1 Pop. "
"Variance</guilabel></quote> and <quote><guilabel>Variable 2 Pop. "
"Variance</guilabel></quote> entries. When you click on "
"<quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote>, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will test whether the mean of the "
"difference between the paired variables is equal to the given hypothesized "
"mean difference."
msgstr ""
"För oparade variabler med kända populationsvarianser anger du varianserna i "
"fälten <quote><guilabel>Populationsvarians för variabel 1</guilabel></quote>"
" och <quote><guilabel>Populationsvarians för variabel 2</guilabel></quote>. "
"När du klickar på <quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote> testar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> om skillnaden mellan variablernas "
"medelvärden är lika med den angivna hypotetiska medelvärdesskillnaden."

